('29_superlative_adjectives.html','Superlative Adjectives','Superlatives menunjukkan tingkat tertinggi: the + adjective-est atau the most + adjective.',[
('She is ___ student in the class.','the tallest',['taller','the more tall','most tall']),('This is ___ test this month.','the most difficult',['more difficult','difficulter','the difficult']),('It is ___ building here.','the oldest',['older','oldest than','more old'])]),
('30_will_shall_future.html','Will & Shall for Future','Will menyatakan prediksi, keputusan spontan, janji; shall lazim untuk saran dengan I/we.',[
('I think it ___ rain tomorrow.','will',['is','did','has']),('___ we start now?','Shall',['Do','Are','Did']),('I ___ help you with the bags.','will',['am did','have','was'])]),
('31_be_going_to.html','Be Going To','Be going to dipakai untuk rencana/niat dan prediksi berdasarkan bukti.',[
('They are going to ___ a new club.','start',['started','starting to','starts']),('She ___ going to study tonight.','is',['does','has','did']),('Look at those clouds! It is going to ___.','rain',['rains','rained','raining to'])]),
('32_adverbs_manner.html','Adverbs of Manner','Adverbs of manner menerangkan bagaimana aksi dilakukan dan sering dibentuk adjective + -ly.',[
('She speaks English ___.','clearly',['clear','clearness','cleared']),('The students worked ___.','carefully',['careful','care','carefulness']),('He ran ___.','quickly',['quick','quicker','quickness'])]),
('33_articles.html','Articles: A, An, The & Zero Article','A/an untuk referensi tunggal nonspesifik, the untuk spesifik, dan zero article untuk general plural/uncountable dalam konteks tertentu.',[
('I saw ___ interesting film.','an',['a','the','no article']),('Please close ___ door.','the',['a','an','no article']),('___ water is essential for life.','no article',['A','An','The'])]),
('34_conjunctions.html','Conjunctions','And menambah informasi, but memberi kontras, or memberi pilihan, because memberi alasan, so memberi akibat.',[
('I was tired, ___ I went to bed early.','so',['because','or','but']),('She stayed home ___ she was sick.','because',['so','and','or']),('Do you want tea ___ coffee?','or',['because','so','but'])]),
('35_basic_word_order.html','Basic Word Order','Urutan dasar kalimat affirmative adalah Subject + Verb + Object/Complement; adverb ditempatkan sesuai fungsi.',[
('Choose the correct sentence: ___','She reads books every night.',['Reads she books every night.','She books reads every night.','Every reads she night books.']),('Choose the correct sentence: ___','They are very happy today.',['They very are happy today.','Are they very happy today.','Very happy they today are.']),('Choose the correct sentence: ___','Rafi plays football after school.',['Rafi football plays after school.','Plays Rafi after school football.','After Rafi plays school football.'])]),
('36_this_vs_it.html','This vs It','This dapat memperkenalkan/menunjuk sesuatu dekat atau ide baru; it biasanya merujuk sesuatu yang sudah disebut atau impersonal.',[
('___ is my new notebook here.','This',['It','They','Those']),('I bought a laptop. ___ is very light.','It',['This are','Those','These']),('___ is raining outside.','It',['This','There are','Those'])]),
]

CSS='''<style>:root{--n:#172554;--b:#2563eb;--l:#dbe4f0}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0;padding:16px 12px 50px;font:16px/1.65 system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Arial;color:#1e293b;overflow-wrap:anywhere}main{max-width:880px;margin:auto}header{padding:22px 20px;border-radius:17px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--n),#1d4ed8);color:#fff}h1{margin:.2em 0;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,2.1rem);line-height:1.2}h2,h3{scroll-margin-top:12px}h2{margin:1.7em 0 .6em;border-bottom:2px solid var(--l);padding-bottom:.3em;color:var(--n);font-size:1.28rem}.box,.read,.q{border:1px solid var(--l);border-radius:12px;padding:13px 15px;margin:1em 0}.box{background:#f8fafc}.read{background:#eff6ff;border-left:5px solid var(--b)}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem}th,td{border:1px solid var(--l);padding:8px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:99px;background:#e2e8f0;font-size:.71rem;font-weight:800}.ans{display:none;margin-top:8px;padding:9px 11px;border-left:4px solid #16a34a;background:#f0fdf4;border-radius:7px}.ans.on{display:block}.opt div{padding:2px 0}button{border:1px solid #94a3b8;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:7px 10px;font:inherit;font-weight:700}.foot{margin-top:25px;border-top:1px solid var(--l);padding-top:10px;color:#64748b;font-size:.82rem}@media(max-width:560px){body{font-size:15px;padding:10px 9px 40px}header,.box,.read,.q{padding:12px}table{display:block;overflow-x:auto}}</style>'''
V=[
{'name':'Maya','name2':'Rafi','group':'the students','place':'the library','day':'Monday','thing':'the science project','city':'Magelang'},
{'name':'Raka','name2':'Sinta','group':'my parents','place':'the school hall','day':'Tuesday','thing':'the class presentation','city':'Yogyakarta'},
{'name':'Nadia','name2':'Bimo','group':'the teachers','place':'the computer room','day':'Wednesday','thing':'the English assignment','city':'Semarang'},
{'name':'Dimas','name2':'Lina','group':'our friends','place':'the museum','day':'Saturday','thing':'the group task','city':'Solo'},
]
R=[
'On {day}, {name} arrives early for English club. {name2} is already near {place}. The group checks {thing}, reads a short notice, and discusses the language carefully.',
'After school, {name} and {name2} work on {thing}. Friends meet near {place}, compare several sentences, and choose the clearest form for their class work.',
'Last {day}, the class visited a learning activity in {city}. {name} took notes while {name2} read the instructions. The teacher asked everyone to notice how small grammar choices change meaning.',
'This week, {name} is preparing for an English assessment. {name2} studies with the same group in {place}. They read short contexts, compare forms, explain answers, and learn from distractors.',
]

def sub(s,v):
    return re.sub(r'\{(\w+)\}',lambda m:str(v.get(m.group(1),m.group(0))),s)
def cap(s): return s.strip()[:1].upper()+s.strip()[1:]
def mix(a,n): return [x for x,_ in sorted([(x,(n*97+i*31)%101) for i,x in enumerate(a)],key=lambda z:z[1])]
def full(p,a,v):
    s=sub(p[0],v); x=sub(a,v)
    if s.lower().startswith('choose the correct sentence:'): return cap(x)
    return cap(re.sub(r'  +',' ',s.replace('___','' if x=='no article' else x)))

def make_page(title, desc, patterns):
    data={'t':title,'d':desc,'e':desc,'p':patterns}
    # examples table
    exrows=''.join(f'<tr><td>{html.escape(full(p,p[1],V[0]))}</td><td>{html.escape(full(p,p[2][0],V[0]))}</td></tr>' for p in patterns)
    js_data=json.dumps(data,ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))
    js_v=json.dumps(V,ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))
    js_r=json.dumps(R,ensure_ascii=False,separators=(',',':'))
    return f'''<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>{html.escape(title)} | StudentPro</title>{CSS}</head><body><main><header><small>TKA · Bahasa Inggris Wajib & Lanjut · Grammar A1</small><h1 id="judul">{html.escape(title)}</h1><p>Materi grammar dan 20 soal kontekstual ala TKA.</p></header><h2 id="konsep">1. Konsep Inti</h2><div class="box"><p>{html.escape(desc)}</p><p>Fokuskan pada fungsi bentuk, hubungan dengan subjek, waktu, jumlah, dan konteks kalimat.</p></div><h2 id="contoh">2. Contoh & Jebakan</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Benar</th><th>Distraktor</th></tr></thead><tbody>{exrows}</tbody></table><h2 id="latihan">3. Latihan TKA — 20 Soal</h2><p>4 bacaan × 5 soal: 12 pilihan ganda dan 8 pilihan ganda kompleks.</p><div id="qs"></div><div class="foot">StudentPro · Cakupan topik mengikuti A1 Grammar Test-English; materi dan soal disusun ulang secara orisinal untuk TKA.</div></main><script>const D={js_data};const V={js_v};const R={js_r};let sub=(s,v)=>s.replace(/\\{{(\\w+)\\}}/g,(_,k)=>v[k]??_),cap=s=>s.trim().replace(/^./,c=>c.toUpperCase()),mix=(a,n)=>a.map((x,i)=>[x,(n*97+i*31)%101]).sort((a,b)=>a[1]-b[1]).map(x=>x[0]);function full(p,a,v){{let s=sub(p[0],v),x=sub(a,v);if(s.toLowerCase().startsWith("choose the correct sentence:"))return cap(x);return cap(s.replace("___",x==="no article"?"":x).replace(/  +/g," "))}}let out="",n=1;for(let g=0;g<4;g++){{let v=V[g];out+=`<h3 id="bacaan-${{g+1}}">Bacaan ${{g+1}}</h3><div class="read"><p>${{sub(R[g],v)}}</p></div>`;for(let z=0;z<3;z++){{let p=D.p[(g+z)%D.p.length],a=[sub(p[1],v),...p[2].map(x=>sub(x,v))].slice(0,4),o=mix(a,n+g),k="ABCD"[o.indexOf(sub(p[1],v))];out+=`<div class="q"><span class="tag">Pilihan Ganda</span><p><b>${{n}}.</b> Pilih bentuk paling tepat sesuai konteks.</p><p><i>${{cap(sub(p[0],v))}}</i></p><div class="opt">${{o.map((x,i)=>`<div>${{"ABCD"[i]}}. ${{x}}</div>`).join("")}}</div>${{btn()}}<div class="ans"><b>ANSWER: ${{k}}</b><br><b>EXPLANATION:</b> ${{D.e}}</div></div>`;n++}}for(let k=0;k<2;k++){{let o=[];for(let j=0;j<4;j++){{let p=D.p[(g+j+k)%D.p.length],ok=(j%2===k),x=full(p,ok?p[1]:p[2][(j+g)%p[2].length],v);o.push({{x,ok}})}}o=mix(o,n+g);let key=o.map((x,i)=>x.ok?"ABCD"[i]:"").filter(Boolean).join(", ");out+=`<div class="q"><span class="tag">Pilihan Ganda Kompleks</span><p><b>${{n}}.</b> Pilih <b>semua</b> kalimat yang tepat.</p><div class="opt">${{o.map((x,i)=>`<div>${{"ABCD"[i]}}. ${{x.x}}</div>`).join("")}}</div>${{btn()}}<div class="ans"><b>ANSWER: ${{key}}</b><br><b>EXPLANATION:</b> ${{D.e}}</div></div>`;n++}}}}function btn(){{return `<button onclick="let a=this.nextElementSibling;a.classList.toggle('on');this.textContent=a.classList.contains('on')?'Sembunyikan':'Lihat jawaban & pembahasan'">Lihat jawaban & pembahasan</button>`}}document.getElementById("qs").innerHTML=out;</script></body></html>'''

def main(outdir):
    root=Path(outdir); root.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
    for filename,title,desc,patterns in TOPICS:
        (root/filename).write_text(make_page(title,desc,patterns),encoding='utf-8')
    links=''.join(f'<li><a href="{fn}">{i+1:02d}. {html.escape(title)}</a></li>' for i,(fn,title,_,_) in enumerate(TOPICS))
    (root/'index.html').write_text(f'<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Grammar A1 TKA | StudentPro</title>{CSS}</head><body><main><header><small>TKA · Bahasa Inggris Wajib & Lanjut</small><h1 id="judul">Grammar A1</h1><p>36 materi grammar terpisah, masing-masing 20 soal.</p></header><h2 id="daftar">Daftar Materi</h2><ol>{links}</ol></main></body></html>',encoding='utf-8')
    print('generated',len(TOPICS),'grammar files')

if __name__=='__main__':
    main(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv)>1 else 'Grammar_A1')
